y the  fell god  one this fire giant thought he would be  free from  instead he would carry this curse until  he is freed from life  soon after the war the fire monks were  tasked to keep guardianship over the  forge  to prevent any from ever igniting the  flame of ruin  contrary to what we see in the game the  fire monks were loyal to the earth tree  long ago  but i believe the fire monks eventually  fell from grace  then came to worship the flame of ruin  before they went down the path of fire  they created spells to protect against  it which were used during the war with  the giants  but when the fire monks were tasked with  guardianship over the flame  they would look into its gaze  its fire would beguile those who would  look within  and they would commit heresy in secret  arghanthy the chief guardian of the  flame would come upon an incantation  that draws directly from the power of  the flame of ruin  a spell that contains fragments of the  fel god still within  he would even come to cast the burn o  flame incantation which directly draws  power from the fire giants then he would  brandish the one-eyed shield which would  depict the malformed one-eyed fell god  of the fire giants  soon their order would devolve into  exiled worshippers and the firemonks  themselves would wear on their chest  armor the grotesque face of the god of  the flame  there would even be tarnished who would  join the fire monks and they would be  known as fling guardians  the taboo of worshiping the flame would  transform into lasting obsessions by  virtue of the fear that they inspire  they would eventually carry sacred seals  that depict the one-eyed god of the fire  giants adorned with braids of red hair  the fireplace who bore the weight of  their duty would eventually carry a  cauldron perched atop their head  furnished with embers  the cauldron would burn and explode  solidifying their faith in the flame  the fire monks would even be on the side  of reichard during the assault on